//Example just
**Create a Task**

***Endpoint***:
POST /v1/tasks

***Description***:
Creates a new task in the system.

***Path Parameters***:
None

***Request Body***:
Send a JSON object containing task details:

{
  "title": "Buy groceries",
  "description": "Milk, Bread, Eggs",
  "dueDate": "2025-03-15"
}

***Response***:
On success, returns a JSON object with task details:

{
  "taskId": "12345",
  "title": "Buy groceries",
  "description": "Milk, Bread, Eggs",
  "dueDate": "2025-03-15",
  "status": "pending"
}

***Response Codes***:

200 OK – Task created successfully
400 Bad Request – Invalid input
500 Internal Server Error – Server-side error
